hwResType OBJECT-TYPE
    SYNTAX      Enumeration
    MAX-ACCESS  unknown
    STATUS      current
    DESCRIPTION
        "System resource type.
Options:
1. memory(1) -indicates the memory resource
2. messageUnits(2)-indicates the message resource
