hwAvgDuty1min OBJECT-TYPE
    SYNTAX      Integer32
    MAX-ACCESS  unknown
    STATUS      current
    DESCRIPTION
        "The value of this object identifies the average CPU usage of a board or entity 1 minute before the data is read."
